==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Gathering Evidence]] in order to do [[Quest:Sweets for Sniffles]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Yarith Yewroot]] located in [[Green Watch]], [[Pony Vale]].
==Objectives==
Yarith at Green Watch has given you a remedy for the Unicorns of Unicorn Forest. Use it to cure their allergies.
*'''Take Yarith's Remedy to Silverspark'''<br>Yarith has given you a remedy to cure the Unicorns of their allergies. Take it to Silverspark in Unicorn Forest as soon as you can.
*'''Find an expert on sweets near Skysong Ledge'''<br>The allergy medicine Yarith gave you needs to be mixed with something sweet before the Unicorns can eat it. Find a sweets expert near Skysong Ledge that can help you find the perfect sweet to mix with!
*'''Bring Marzipan some Vanilla Ice Cream'''<br>Marzipan thinks Vanilla Ice Cream will mix perfectly with Yarith's Remedy. Go buy some from Razzle the Robgoblin then bring it back to Marzipan for a taste test.
*'''Bring Marzipan some Chocolate Ice Cream'''<br>Vanilla was a bust, but Marzipan is sure that Chocolate Ice Cream will mix perfectly with Yarith's Remedy. Go buy some from Razzle the Robgoblin then bring it back to Marzipan for a taste test.
*'''Take the Mixed Remedy to Silverspark'''<br>Marzipan has given Yarith's Chocolate Ice Cream Mixed Remedy her stamp of approval. Deliver it to Silverspark and the other Unicorns of Unicorn Forest as fast as you can.
